---
import Link from '@/components/link.astro';
import Page from '@/layouts/page.astro';
---

<Page>
  <h1 class='font-medium font-mozilla-headline text-xl md:text-2xl'>Yanick Bélanger</h1>

  <p class='font-mozilla-text mt-5 text-base'>
    I&apos;m a Software Engineer at <Link href='https://vercel.com' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'
      >Vercel</Link
    >, where I have been fortunate to solve a variety of problems across Trust & Safety, Platform Engineering, CDN, and
    Identity. In the past, I worked on the <Link
      href='https://www.partage.club'
      rel='noopener noreferrer'
      target='_blank'>Partage Club</Link
    > and <Link href='https://www.mogo.ca' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'>MogoTrade</Link> mobile applications
    over my 6-year career.
  </p>

  <p class='font-mozilla-text mt-5 text-base'>
    I have a passion for building scalable, reliable, and resilient systems that cross language boundaries. Outside of
    work, I dedicate my time to learning about urban planning, creative writing, and other non-technical topics.
  </p>

  <p class='font-mozilla-text mt-5 text-base'>
    Check out my <Link href='https://github.com/emeraldsanto' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'>code</Link>, <Link
      href='https://instagram.com/yan.blgr'
      rel='noopener noreferrer'
      target='_blank'>photography</Link
    >, or <Link href='https://www.goodreads.com/emeraldsanto' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'
      >book reviews</Link
    >. Get in touch at <Link href='https://x.com/yanthedev' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'>@yanthedev</Link> or
    <Link href='mailto:hey@yanickbelanger.dev'>hey@yanickbelanger.dev</Link> if you see anything you like.
  </p>
</Page>
